and complete upstream license text are retained.

Local modifications:
- Import paths point to the copied standard-library-only internal helpers.
- JSON decoding uses Go's encoding/json rather than the SDK's segmentio wrapper,
  avoiding the SDK dependency tree.
- Dynamic-registration responses retain the RFC 7592 management URI and token.
- Literal private IPs are not pre-rejected by URL validation: the supplied
  Agent Vault dialer enforces its instance allowlist on the connected address.
- Repeated identical application/json Content-Type values are accepted for
  GitHub metadata compatibility; mixed or invalid media types are rejected.

Agent Vault supplies its guarded HTTP client to discovery and registration.
